---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Rules — aicqtools" locale="en">
  <h1>Built-in ruleset (37)</h1>
  <p>
    Per-rule detail pages are auto-generated by the <code>aicq docs build</code> command.
    Phase 1b will add 13 FSC/PCI rules → 50 total.
  </p>

  <h2>TypeScript globals (20)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>no-direct-openai</code>, <code>no-direct-anthropic</code> — enforce llmClient singleton</li>
    <li><code>api-response-shape</code> — `&#123; success, data, message &#125;` standard</li>
    <li><code>route-needs-rate-limit</code>, <code>route-needs-auth</code>, <code>controller-needs-async-wrapper</code> — route middleware</li>
    <li><code>no-id-overwrite</code>, <code>no-jsonb-circular</code> — data safety</li>
    <li><code>no-inline-math-round</code>, <code>no-inline-date</code>, <code>no-magic-number</code> — no inline computation</li>
    <li><code>fk-needs-on-delete</code> — Sequelize FK policy</li>
    <li><code>no-bare-throw</code>, <code>no-empty-catch</code> — error handling</li>
    <li><code>no-console-log</code>, <code>no-process-env-leak</code> — production hygiene</li>
    <li><code>no-default-export-from-libs</code>, <code>prefer-named-imports</code>, <code>prefer-const-array</code>, <code>no-boolean-trap</code> — code quality</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Python globals (10)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>requests-needs-timeout</code> — timeout required on requests calls</li>
    <li><code>no-pickle</code>, <code>no-shell-true</code>, <code>no-fstring-sql</code> — security</li>
    <li><code>no-mutable-default-arg</code>, <code>no-bare-except</code> — Python pitfalls</li>
    <li><code>type-hint-required-public</code>, <code>async-await-consistency</code> — code quality</li>
    <li><code>no-print-in-prod</code>, <code>pytest-fixture-naming</code> — operations / test hygiene</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Korean IT conventions (7) ★</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>camelcase-migration-column</code> — Sequelize migration column names</li>
    <li><code>enforce-utf8-encoding</code>, <code>korean-comment-encoding</code> — encoding</li>
    <li><code>explicit-kst-timezone</code> — explicit KST timezone</li>
    <li><code>won-format-thousands</code> — won amount thousand separators</li>
    <li><code>rfc5987-korean-filename</code> — Content-Disposition Korean filenames</li>
    <li><code>naver-kakao-oauth-webview</code> — Capacitor OAuth WebView pattern</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top:2rem">
    Disable a rule by adding <code>{`{ 'rule-id': 'off' }`}</code> to <code>modules.guardrail.rules</code> in <code>aicq.config.yaml</code>.
  </p>
</Layout>
